start/

# what packaging writes. `out` holds the icons, the dmg, the zip and the
# installer, and `cache` holds the node builds they are made from. all of it
# is derived from what is committed, and a repo that keeps both has two
# answers to what shipped.
packaging/out/
packaging/cache/

# local notes and settings that belong to this clone rather than to keeper,
# the same as the file above. neither is anything a person using keeper needs.
.claude/
